          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.085,
            0.42,
            0.107
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Keep the curiosity alive"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.12,
            0.715,
            0.14
          ],
          "content": "1. State whether the following statements are True or False."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.141,
            0.743,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": "(i) We can only see that part of the Moon which reflects sunlight towards us."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.181,
            0.743,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "(ii) The shadow of Earth blocks sunlight from reaching the Moon causing phases."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.22,
            0.743,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Calendars are based on various astronomical cycles which repeat in a predictable manner."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.26,
            0.551,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "(iv) The Moon can only be seen at night."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.285,
            0.744,
            0.341
          ],
          "content": "2. Amol was born on 6th of May on a full Moon day. Does his birthday fall on the full Moon day every year? Explain your answer."
        },
